cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the OBSERVE Search API or its client tools, please cite it as below."
title: "OBSERVE Search API: pay-per-query semantic code search for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A hosted, pay-per-query semantic code-search API built for AI agents to call
  directly, with a fully automated signup-to-search loop, Stripe-backed prepaid
  credits, per-key isolation, and an ACP-compatible agentic-commerce discovery
  and reputation layer. Client core shared across a CLI, an MCP server, and
  LangChain / CrewAI adapters.
type: software
